:: Jackson Eat Lunch Pea [nobr]

/* Intro */
/* Written by: Zexion */
Spending time with <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Jackson</span> is always a treat, you never know what you will get with your friend. His excitable personality, plus his tendency to be a little unpredictable, always made hanging out with him fun, even if you’re eating with him this time, being no exception with him regaling you with another story of his adventures. Though you’d wish he’d slow down a tiny bit, because while telling his story, he’s shoveling food down and not chewing it properly. So, while you’re hearing a regaling tale of bug catching in the woods, you're also given a front row seat to <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Jackson</span>’s gross but amazing ability to talk and eat at the same time. <br>
<br>
<span style="color:lightsteelblue">“And that's how I got all the butterflies to fly around me! Who knew covering myself in expired fruit juice would be so affective? It smelt REALLY bad though, like my mom was complaining for MONTHS!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Jackson</span> proudly said. Blinking in confusion, you ask him to repeat himself. You zoned out somewhere between this story and the last. Your friend thankfully doesn’t realize this and instead takes it as a chance to continue. He then tells you how, when they went home, <span style="color:Pink">he got a spanking once he told his mom what he did.</span> <span style="color:lightsteelblue">“Yeah, but I learned my lesson! Now I take off all my clothes before covering myself in anything like juice or honey. The smell isn't as strong and I can just hop in the lake to wash it off! Though one time the honey attracted a fish that tried to nibble on my..!”</span> He says smiling. <br>

    <<set _ad to [
            {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
				Mouth: "Frown",
    		},	
        },
        {
            Name: "Jackson",
            State: {
				Outfit: "Uniform",
				Mouth: "Happy",
    		},	
        },
    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>

Incredulously, you don’t know what's weirder than the fact that <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Jackson</span> habitually goes into the woods to cover himself in sugary liquids to attract insects. Or how the only lesson he got from the spanking was to better care for his clothes. As you stare at your friend, you notice that lodged between his teeth, where a missing tooth should be, is a pea. Wanting to change the subject and help your friend, you point out he has something in his teeth. <br>
<br>
<span style="color:lightsteelblue">“What where?”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Jackson</span> asks. He then tries and fails to get the stuck pea, completely missing it to a humorous degree, asking if he got it and when failing, trying again and again. It’s after watching this routine for a while that you eventually decide to help him. You reach over and poke the pea past his teeth and onto his tongue, watching him reactively swallow. <br>

